<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weakens against dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weakens against dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened against both the dollar and pound on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 20.692 on Monday from 20.684 last Friday. Against the pound, the rupee weakened to a mean of 32.9160 from Friday's 32.8165.</p>
</text>
